window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When the line between life and death blurs, what price will you pay to protect the ones you love?<br> <br> Joey McCreary’s life takes a chilling turn during a mundane night shift at Sunny’s Diner when Death himself offers a deal: an extension of life in exchange for becoming the Reaper’s apprentice. But as Joey collects souls, the weight of his choices grows unbearable, dragging him deeper into a world where morality and mortality clash.<br> <br> Caught in a sinister web of cosmic balance, Joey must confront his darkest fears and the ultimate sacrifice to redeem himself. Guided by an ancient force of compassion, he discovers that Death is more than an end, it’s a transition, an eternal dance.<br> <br> In <i>Shadows of the Reaper</i>, R.T. Dixon weaves a gripping tale of redemption, sacrifice, and the fragile beauty of life. Perfect for fans of dark fantasy and supernatural thrillers, this story will haunt you long after the final tick.</p>"; 
